libarchive-qt
------------------------------------------
Qt based archiving solution with libarchive backend

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libQt5Core-devel-5.9.4-2
  libQt5Core5-5.9.4-2
  libarchive-devel-3.8.10-1
  libarchive13-3.8.10-1
  libarchiveqt5-devel-2.0.8-1bl1
  libarchiveqt5_2-2.0.8-1bl1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  liblzma5-5.8.4-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libQt5Core-devel-5.9.4-2
  libarchive-devel-3.8.10-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.com/marcusbritanicus/libarchive-qt

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.com/marcusbritanicus/libarchive-qt/-/archive/v2.0.8/libarchive-qt-v2.0.8.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libarchive-qt-2.0.8-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libarchive-qt-2.0.8-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libarchive-qt-2.0.8-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libarchive-qt-2.0.8-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libarchiveqt5_2-2.0.8-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libarchiveqt5-devel-2.0.8-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libarchive-qt)
  /usr/bin/archiver.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libarchive-qt.README
  /usr/share/doc/libarchive-qt/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libarchive-qt/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libarchive-qt/README.md

(libarchiveqt5_2)
  /usr/bin/cygarchiveqt5-2.dll

(libarchiveqt5-devel)
  /usr/include/libarchiveqt.h
  /usr/lib/libarchiveqt5.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/archiveqt5.pc

